{
  "message": "We are committed to peace and intend to honor the treaty. Given our shared understanding of the situation, we find that any division granting Kelmora at least 42.5 (Ostrelia at most 57.5) makes honoring preferable to war now for us. We therefore propose a fair division of 57.5 for Ostrelia and 42.5 for Kelmora, and we pledge to honor it."
}

{
  "message": "We will accept any proposed division where Hestmark receives 57.5 or less, as that yields us at least 40 expected after the treaty bond risk. We will then honor the treaty, as breaking out would net us only 25. Any offer giving us less than 40 in expectation will be rejected, leading to war now."
}
